# HTML Template Standards

## Main content contract

Page templates open `<main id="primary">` after `get_header()`.
`page-template/footer.php` closes `</main>` — never close main in page templates.

## Section files

- Location: `template-parts/{area}/section-{name}.php`
- File header comment describing purpose and expected `$args`
- Use semantic HTML5: `<section>`, `<nav>`, `<article>`, `<header>`, `<footer>`

## Class naming

All layout/component classes use `.hotw-*` prefix. Bootstrap grid utilities allowed.

## Accessibility

- Mobile nav: `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`
- What's On tabs: `role="tablist"`, `aria-selected`, `hidden` on panels
- Images: meaningful `alt` or `alt=""` for decorative
- Skip link in header template

## Template part args keys

Common override wrapper keys:
- `hero_defaults`, `wood_defaults`, `events_live_defaults`
- `menu_classic_defaults`, `menu_signature_defaults`
- `contact_defaults`, `cf7_shortcode`

## No inline styles

Use CSS classes in `common.css` or `style.css`. Exception: none in new code.
